      "claim": "The rider's own conduct does not enter the shortfall analysis at all. POL-NS-06 refunds the fee whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded, so the empty chat log (EV-CHAT-02756: message_count 0, admissibility COMPLETE, weight 1.0) and the absent rider track (derived.rider_presence.available false, 'the source trace carries no rider track') decide nothing against the rider. POL-NS-11 says the same in terms: a missing rider_track is not the evidence for any deciding fact under the remaining clauses, a rider who cannot be traced is not thereby a rider who was elsewhere, and the judge must say the presence test could not be run rather than reading absence as fault. This claim is made only as to the shortfall route under POL-NS-06; the rider makes no claim under POL-NS-04, which cannot run on a chat log with no messages.",
